# Calibration

Full skill: `docs/skills/calibration.md`

- Snapshot on desk refresh. After close, join Kalshi `result`. Auto-settle matching lots 100/0.
- Brier `(fair − y)²`. Skill = market Brier − model Brier (positive = model won).
- Honest (headline): mid ∈ (0.08, 0.92) and snap ≥ 90s before close.
- Default Score filter is Honest. Do not treat ladder rungs as independent samples.
- Fastest loop is 15m BTC/ETH.
